{"id":"484f25b1605a2149","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-strengthchow.md","title":"Strength comparison and Chow parameters","display":"thm-strengthchow — Strength comparison and Chow parameters","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-strengthchow","aliases":["27-thm-strengthchow"],"display":"thm-strengthchow — Strength comparison and Chow parameters","depends_on":["[[27-df-regular]]","[[27-df-chow]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-strengthchow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-strengthchow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strengthchow — Strength comparison and Chow parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in[n]\">\\(i,j\\in[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f\">\\(\\succeq_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i(f)\">\\(c_i(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\succeq_f j\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)\\geq c_j(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\succeq_f j\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)\\geq c_j(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(i\\succeq_f j\\land\\neg(j\\succeq_f i)\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)&gt;c_j(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(i\\succeq_f j\\land\\neg(j\\succeq_f i)\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)&gt;c_j(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)=c_j(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)=c_j(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §8.2，Theorem 8.4，印刷 pp.355–356／PDF pp.379–380；已核对陈述与证明。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=x_j=1\">\\(x_i=x_j=1\\)</span> 的真点分量抵消后，逐个配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=1,x_j=0\">\\(x_i=1,x_j=0\\)</span> 与交换后的点；强度提供每对贡献的非负性，严格强度提供至少一对严格贡献。</li>\n<li>不把数值大小关系反向推出强度比较；那一方向需要另外的适用条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-chow]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i,j\\in[n]$；$\\succeq_f$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，$c_i(f)$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i,j\\in[n]$；$\\succeq_f$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，$c_i(f)$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f","display":false},{"tex":"c_i(f)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\succeq_f j\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)\\geq c_j(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(i\\succeq_f j\\land\\neg(j\\succeq_f i)\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)>c_j(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ c_i(f)=c_j(f).","display":true},{"tex":"x_i=x_j=1","display":false},{"tex":"x_i=1,x_j=0","display":false}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-563","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-strengthchow|thm-strengthchow — Strength comparison and Chow parameters]]"}],"outgoing":["6ae49270bb9c0b4f","260aad3bc2408854"]}